"""Own metadata preflight count correction; never invokes a subject."""
import ast,base64,datetime,hashlib,json,os,pathlib
D=pathlib.Path(__file__).parent;R=D.parent
def fact(p,b=None):
    if b is None:b=p.read_bytes()
    return dict(path=str(p),bytes=len(b),sha256=hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest())
def fresh():
    p=R/'ROOT_CURRENT_I13_RETENTION_SOURCE_QUALIFICATION_SCOPE_008.json';b=p.read_bytes();assert hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest()=='6b0562d5c5df10afb6cea07771a75da7b5df03632144e8b625f37ef5f747c515';s=json.loads(b.decode('utf8'));n=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc);assert datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(s['interval_start'])<=n<datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(s['interval_end'])-datetime.timedelta(seconds=60);return n.isoformat(timespec='microseconds')
def save(name,b):
    p=D/name;assert not os.path.lexists(p)and 0<len(b)<=2097152;fresh()
    with p.open('xb')as f:assert f.write(b)==len(b);f.flush();os.fsync(f.fileno())
    assert p.read_bytes()==b;return fact(p,b)
p=D/'author_fixture016_retention_Source_API_and_evidence_001.py';before=p.read_bytes();assert fact(p,before)['sha256']=='57ad6d512271df0908d2533c03ea30f0e3c5bf936ccb9866d3cbe38019ddad3f'
changes=[("==249,'original249 M3 rows'","==247,'original247 M3 rows'"),("'unchanged687 peer Source'","'unchanged689 peer Source'"),("==687,'original687 peer rows'","==689,'original689 peer rows'"),("old_M3_CASE_CATALOGUE_rows=249","old_M3_CASE_CATALOGUE_rows=247"),("old_peer_CASE_CATALOGUE_rows=687","old_peer_CASE_CATALOGUE_rows=689"),("metadata_author_only=True","retained_metadata_author001_refusal=fact(D/'I13_RETENTION016_METADATA_AUTHOR002_COMPLETE001_INVERSE_AND_COUNT_REFUSAL_001.json'),metadata_author_only=True")]
text=before.decode('utf8')
for old,new in changes:assert text.count(old)==1;text=text.replace(old,new)
after=text.encode('utf8');ast.parse(after.decode('utf8'))
assert not os.path.lexists(D/'exercise_M3_guard_and_publisher_metadata_memory_016.py')and not os.path.lexists(D/'I13_RAW_INPUT_RETENTION_EXPORTER_INERT_API_001.json')
successor=save('author_fixture016_retention_Source_API_and_evidence_002.py',after)
v=dict(schema_version=1,record_type='I13_retention016_metadata_author002_complete001_count_refusal_inverse',author='/root/project_architecture',created_utc=fresh(),predecessor=fact(p,before),successor=successor,whole_predecessor_base64=base64.b64encode(before).decode('ascii'),exact_changes=[dict(before=a,after=b)for a,b in changes],retained_own_preflight_refusal=dict(tool_chunk='d0b11f',actual_exit=1,exception='ValueError',message='original249 M3 rows',error='Own author incorrectly assumed249M3+687peer. Exact unchanged Sources have247M3+689peer=936.',fixture_API_and_final_evidence_outputs_created=0,subject_calls=0),all_old_source_bytes_unchanged=True,target_execution=False,operational_authority=False,scientific_authority=False)
inv=save('I13_RETENTION016_METADATA_AUTHOR002_COMPLETE001_INVERSE_AND_COUNT_REFUSAL_001.json',(json.dumps(v,sort_keys=True,indent=2)+'\n').encode('utf8'));assert base64.b64decode(v['whole_predecessor_base64'],validate=True)==before
print(json.dumps(dict(successor=successor,inverse=inv),ensure_ascii=True))
